<title>INDIA: India sets 20 bln rupee bond auction for Sept 17.</title>
<headline>India sets 20 bln rupee bond auction for Sept 17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India will sell 20 billion rupees' worth of six-year bonds on September 17, the government said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The government said in a statement that the bonds, or government stock, are eligible for ready forward facility.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
